{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"Here are the most up-to-date estimates for Japan"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"’s population, based on official Japanese government statistics and reputable international sources:\n\n1"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":".  According to the **Statistics Bureau of Japan**, the"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":" total population as of October 1, 2025 (from the preliminary"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":" counts of the 2025 Population Census),"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":" was approximately **123.05 million**. This represented a decrease of"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":" about 3.097 million people (–2.5%) compared to the 2020 census"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":". "}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"([stat.go.jp](https://www.stat.go.jp/english/info/news/20260625.html?utm_source=openai)"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":")\n\n2.  The **Population Estimates**, based on calculations as of **June 1, "}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"2026**, indicate a total population of approximately **122."}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"85 million** (this figure is provisional). ([stat.go.jp](https://www.stat.go.jp/data/jinsui/?vm=r&utm_source=openai))\n\nTherefore"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":", as of **July 31, 2026**—the current date—the most recent and authoritative estimate places Japan"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":"’s population at **approximately 122.85 million** residents.\n\nIf"}
{"type":"text-delta","id":"msg_05e62118df42d4d5016a6ce07a3b18819da6fade06ae53be13","delta":" you'd like, I can also provide details on the age distribution or foreign resident population."}
